web='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Mini-IPHOREOS project</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f3f8f8;color:#0f1e2e;font:17px/1.6 Arial}header{background:#0f1e2e;color:white;padding:45px 7%}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:25px}h1{font-size:42px;line-height:1.1}h2{color:#0d8080}a{color:#0d8080}header a{color:#17c4b0}.card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:15px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 4px 16px #0f1e2e0b}.hero{width:100%;max-height:450px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px}.links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px}.links a,button{background:#0d8080;color:white;padding:10px 18px;border:0;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}canvas{width:100%;background:#eef5f5;border-radius:10px}input{width:100%}select{padding:8px}.muted{color:#526c7c;font-size:14px}</style><header><p>BUILD • UNDERSTAND • TEST</p><h1>Mini-IPHOREOS</h1><p>A mathematical model you can watch become physical movement.</p><a href="Tutorial_A_to_Z.html">Read the illustrated A–Z guide →</a></header><main><img class="hero" src="assets/robot_concept.png"><p class="muted">AI-generated concept illustration, not a photograph of the purchased kit.</p><div class="card"><h2>Start here</h2><div class="links"><a href="Tutorial_A_to_Z.pdf">PDF tutorial</a><a href="Tutorial_A_to_Z.html">Browser tutorial</a><a href="shopping_list.csv">Shopping list</a><a href="flash/01_sensor_only.py">Sensor-only program</a></div><p>Planning envelope: <b>€107.28</b>, including delivery allowance and reserve. The package has been tested on a computer. You will validate the actual robot after assembly.</p></div><div class="card"><h2>Watch the software loop</h2><p>Saved synthetic trajectory, seed 7. This replay does not control hardware.</p><label>Controller <select id="policy"><option value="mini">Mini</option><option value="belief">Belief baseline</option><option value="raw">Raw baseline</option></select></label> <button id="play">Play / pause</button><canvas id="scene" width="1050" height="270"></canvas><input id="step" type="range" min="0" max="1" value="0"><p id="status"></p><p class="muted">The wall is fixed. The body position is an illustrative mapping of the simulated sensor distance; no mechanical dimensions are asserted.</p></div><div class="card"><h2>What is inside?</h2><p>Seven robot programs • one shared mathematical controller • desktop tests • 3,600 synthetic trials • calibration tools • blank measurement sheets • ten editable diagrams • two experiment plots.</p><img style="width:100%" src="assets/benchmark.png"><p>Unknown sensor bias can defeat all three controllers. Read the stress results before interpreting a happy face as real success.</p></div></main><script>const traces=TRACES;let timer=null;const canvas=document.getElementById('scene'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'),slider=document.getElementById('step'),select=document.getElementById('policy');function draw(){const data=traces[select.value];slider.max=data.length-1;let i=Math.min(Number(slider.value),data.length-1);slider.value=i;const r=data[i];ctx.clearRect(0,0,1050,270);ctx.fillStyle='#be986c';ctx.fillRect(950,35,28,160);ctx.fillStyle='#17c4b055';ctx.fillRect(950-29*8,45,8*8,150);let x=950-r.true_cm*8;ctx.fillStyle='#0d8080';ctx.fillRect(x-100,95,100,60);ctx.fillStyle='#0f1e2e';ctx.fillRect(x-85,82,30,15);ctx.fillRect(x-85,153,30,15);ctx.font='18px Arial';ctx.fillText('Cardboard wall',850,230);ctx.fillText('Target: 25 cm',650,70);ctx.fillText('Robot',Math.max(10,x-95),200);document.getElementById('status').textContent='t = '+r.time_s.toFixed(2)+' s | '+r.action+' | '+r.reason+' | true distance '+r.true_cm.toFixed(1)+' cm | belief '+(r.mu_cm===null?'unknown':r.mu_cm.toFixed(1)+' ± '+r.sd_cm.toFixed(1)+' cm (1 SD)');}slider.oninput=draw;select.onchange=()=>{slider.value=0;draw()};document.getElementById('play').onclick=()=>{if(timer){clearInterval(timer);timer=null;return}if(Number(slider.value)>=Number(slider.max))slider.value=0;timer=setInterval(()=>{if(Number(slider.value)>=Number(slider.max)){clearInterval(timer);timer=null;return}slider.value=Number(slider.value)+1;draw()},180)};draw();</script></html>'''
